{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randy The Racoon might not be the prettiest game, but it's full of character. Here's a list of things that make it so full of character:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of crazy weapons at randy's disposal like a balloon gun, stink tornados &amp; a radio that attracts humans like light does mosquitos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of humans walking to test your weapons on or just hit and run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny animals to talk to and accept missions from like Crazy Coq, Chip the Mechanic, a Cult Leader Capybara &amp; more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive map, the map has been filled with interaction such as cliffs with a certain weight limit, a big catapult, snowballs you can roll to grow, and more. In combination with your weapons you can create any situation to torture NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd9d <strong>A Raccoon with Attitude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randy isn\u2019t just your average raccoon\u2014he\u2019s got opinions, and he\u2019s not afraid to share them! Run into a wall? He\u2019ll yell \u201cOw!\u201d Take a dive? He\u2019ll blame you for getting him wet. Every crash, stunt, and silly moment comes with Randy\u2019s signature commentary and expressive reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.poster.avif?t=1761522896\" width=790 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.webm?t=1761522896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.mp4?t=1761522896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udf0e <strong>A Vibrant, Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling island filled with colorful NPCs to meet and missions to complete. From sassy animals to the infamous goose gang, every corner of the map is bursting with personality and surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.poster.avif?t=1761522896\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.webm?t=1761522896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.mp4?t=1761522896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Your Car, Your Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ride to suit your chaotic style. Add a jumping mechanism, boost your speed, or paint it to match Randy\u2019s questionable taste. Your car isn\u2019t just transportation\u2014it\u2019s a tool for mayhem!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/5df3cc96b7ea0fa9e007f1891b630bf0.poster.avif?t=1761522896\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/5df3cc96b7ea0fa9e007f1891b630bf0.webm?t=1761522896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/5df3cc96b7ea0fa9e007f1891b630bf0.mp4?t=1761522896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2>","background":"https://store.a